<h3 style="text-align: center;font-family:Abril Fatface;font-weight:400;font-style:normal" class="vc_custom_heading vc_do_custom_heading sol-blurb-title group-title" ><a href="https://rr-mfg.com/" target="_blank">R&amp;R Manufacturing</a></h3>
	<div class="wpb_text_column wpb_content_element solution-blurb-txt" >
		<div class="wpb_wrapper">
			<p style="text-align: center;">R&amp;R Manufacturing specializes in manufacturing and custom fabrication. This division supports multi-unit projects across various sectors, including high-pressure systems, by leveraging in-house manufacturing capabilities. By reducing dependency on external suppliers, R&amp;R Manufacturing ensures high-quality outcomes and enhances project execution. Their expertise in custom fabrication design solutions is vital for complex energy projects, providing tailored and efficient solutions that meet the unique demands of each project.</p>

